# Keeps the build context small and, more importantly, keeps secrets out of the
# image entirely. A .env excluded here can never end up in a layer, which is
# the only reliable fix -- deleting it in a later RUN does not remove it from
# the earlier layer (B1 task 25).
node_modules
npm-debug.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.gitignore
*.md
tests
coverage
evidence
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
